OL,3,GNEWSABomb squad goes to house after
OL,4,A'unexpected' death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe bomb squad has removed substances
OL,7,Ffrom a house after a man was found dead
OL,8,Finside.
OL,10,FMerseyside Police said the man in his
OL,11,F20s was found in a property on
OL,12,FReedville in Oxton near Birkenhead,
OL,13,FWirral, just before 16:00 GMT on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe force said his sudden death was
OL,17,Fbeing treated as "unexpected" and his
OL,18,Fnext of kin had been told. A file has
OL,19,Fbeen passed to the coroner.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,405,400,260,160,0,100
