OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice said the explosive ordnance
OL,7,Fdisposal team removed "substances
OL,8,Flocated inside the premises" as a
OL,9,Fprecaution but "deemed there is no
OL,10,Fwider risk to the public at this
OL,11,Fstage".
